{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39047","headline":"红蔷薇歌 · 王毂","name":"红蔷薇歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"红霞烂泼猩猩血，阿母瑶池晒仙缬。\n晚日春风夺眼明，蜀机锦彩浑疑黦。\n公子亭台香触人，百花懡㦬无精神。\n苎罗西子见应妬，风光占断年年新。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王毂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39047.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39047","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}